# NervaOne Changes

## 1.3.0 (2026-07-07)
- Add mining affinity toggle for Nerva: pin mining threads to physical CPU cores, sent via the start_mining RPC and the --mining-affinity daemon flag. Default on for desktop, off on Android.
- Update CLI download links: Nerva to v0.3.0.0, Dash to v23.1.7, Wownero desktop to v0.11.4.0 (Android stays on v0.11.3.0, which is the last Wownero release with an Android build).
- Use a cryptographic RNG for generated credentials and payment IDs.
- Fix precision loss in atomic-unit to amount conversion.
- Require a password on BTC-based wallet creation and restore.

## 1.2.0 (2026-06-10)
- Add Litecoin (LTC) support and related improvements.
- Add wallet-rpc Digest authentication and improve credential handling.
- Restart wallet RPC immediately when switching to wallet-only mode.
- Add coin-specific default prune size and fix Download Blockchain Db visibility.
- Fix MWEB transfer display and BTC-based wallet URL routing for LTC.
- Sort Transfers grid by timestamp.
- Remove macOS quarantine from CLI tools after download.
- CI: post artifact links as a PR comment after build and fix duplicate CI runs.

## 1.1.0 (2026-05-29)
- Add Bitcoin (BTC) support: seed-based create/restore, dump-file restore, pruned node improvements, and warmup handling.
- Add pruned node support to coin setup and daemon setup.
- Add a two-phase transfer flow and Transfers UI improvements.
- Replace scattered daemon state flags with a DaemonState enum.
- Replace hardcoded coin ComboBoxes with dynamic binding and add coin capability flags.
- Remove iOS and Browser projects and update Avalonia packages to 11.3.x.
- Fix path traversal in ImportWallet and pin GitHub Actions to commit SHAs.
- Fix balance precision display.
- Update default CLI links.

## 1.0.0 (2026-04-28)
- Rename app to NervaOne: non-custodial wallet and CPU miner supporting Nerva (XNV), Monero (XMR), Wownero (WOW), and Dash (DASH) on Windows, Linux, macOS, and Android.
- Full node, pruned node, and wallet-only modes with QuickSync support.
- Reject wallet names containing path traversal characters and clear the wallet password hash on close.
- Fix UI-thread blocking, process pipe deadlocks, and an ANR during blockchain DB extraction.
